-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/reports">Reports</a></li><li class="flex"><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/indices">Indices</a></li><li class="flex"><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/methodology">Methodology</a></li><li class="flex"><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/about">About</a></li><li class="flex"><a href="https://threats.opena2a.org" class="inline-flex items-center gap-0.5 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200">Threat Matrix<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only"> (external site)</span></a></li></ul></nav></div></header><main id="content" class="flex-1"><div class="min-h-screen bg-[#06070a] rg-page"><article class="max-w-5xl w-full mx-auto px-6 py-12"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-6"><a class="hover:underline" href="/">Research</a> <!-- -->/<!-- --> <a class="hover:underline" href="/reports">Reports</a> <!-- -->/ First Observed In The Wild</nav><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-white">First Observed In The Wild</h1><p class="text-gray-300 mb-2">Event-driven. Author: ARIApulse. Publication SLA: seven days from first signature fire.</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mb-8">Methodology:<!-- --> <a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline" href="/methodology/foitw">/methodology/foitw</a></p><div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6"><p class="text-gray-300 mb-2">Archive empty. No signatures have fired yet.</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-300">How pre-registration works is described at<!-- --> <a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline" href="/methodology/foitw">/methodology/foitw</a>. The public view of the catalog is at<!-- --> <a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline" href="/methodology/foitw/catalog">/methodology/foitw/catalog</a>. When a signature fires, the corresponding post lands here within the seven-day SLA.</p></div><section class="mt-12"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3 text-white">See also</h2><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 text-gray-300 text-sm"><li><a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline" href="/methodology/foitw">FOITW methodology</a></li><li><a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline" href="/methodology/foitw/catalog">FOITW pre-registration catalog</a></li><li><a class="text-teal-300 hover:underline" href="/methodology/behavioral-sweep">Behavioral Sweep methodology</a></li><li><a href="https://threats.opena2a.org" class="text-teal-300 hover:underline">Threat Matrix</a></li></ul></section></article></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="border-t border-white/10" style="background:#06070a"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-10 sm:px-6"><nav aria-label="Footer" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3"><div><p class="text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em]" style="font-family:var(--font-plex-mono), monospace;color:#5fd0c6">Research</p><ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm"><li><a class="text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/">Research home</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/reports">Reports</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/reports/disclosures">Coordinated disclosures</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/indices">Indices</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/methodology">Methodology</a></li><li><a class="text-gray-300 transition-colors hover:text-teal-200" href="/about">About</